<title>USA: Great American Banc cleared for buyback.</title>
<headline>Great American Banc cleared for buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CHAMPAIGN, Ill. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great American Bancorp Inc said Thursday it has received regulatory clearance to purchase up to five percent or 87,999 shares of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>Directors of the company previously authorized, subject to regulatory clearance, the repurchase of up to five percent of the company's 1,759,976 outstanding shares.</p>
<p>Stock repurchases will be made in open market transactions and will begin soon after the release of the company's earnings for the quarter ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Shares of Great American Bancorp were trading up 1/8 to 16-3/8.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
